title: Avoid duplicate-request penalties during fork recovery
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
  description: |-
    Chain sync preserves valid pending fork downloads from other peers when an `UnknownParent` result restarts sync. This avoids repeated identical requests that can get the requesting node incorrectly penalized (and banned on stable2603).
crates:
- name: sc-network-sync
  bump: patch
